{
  "name": "HL · Backup workflows → GitHub (B4)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Backup workflows → GitHub\nBoss 4 (from 3.8). Nightly at 02:00: every workflow from the n8n API is saved as a file in a PRIVATE GitHub repo, creating or updating each file.\n\nThe lesson uses the n8n and GitHub nodes; this template calls both APIs with HTTP Request so it imports on any version.\n\n**Credentials:** Header Auth \"n8n API\" (Name X-N8N-API-KEY, Value your n8n API key); Header Auth \"GitHub backup\" (Name Authorization, Value Bearer + a fine-grained token limited to this repo, contents read/write).\n**Replace:** YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN; YOUR_GITHUB_OWNER (3 places).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "a09b3559-e5e3-49d6-95c2-c518a9ab4b5f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "176a76d6-bd73-4a48-b101-18401d85d302",
      "name": "Every day at 02:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://YOUR_N8N_DOMAIN/api/v1/workflows",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "250"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c32a1353-886b-4316-8569-0f8310e5fbd5",
      "name": "Get all workflows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "data",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d8cc1bb2-bb42-4862-87db-86f5272ed2a4",
      "name": "One item per workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return { json: { path: `workflows/${$json.name.replace(/[^\\w-]+/g, '_')}.json`,\n  content: Buffer.from(JSON.stringify($json, null, 2)).toString('base64') } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "22567c1b-0236-4128-b81c-9a7e66d51029",
      "name": "Make file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/YOUR_GITHUB_OWNER/harvestlane-n8n/contents/{{ $json.path }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "6ec3acf0-238b-43e9-9474-6689b4a4a25c",
      "name": "Current file (sha)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/YOUR_GITHUB_OWNER/harvestlane-n8n/contents/{{ $('Make file').item.json.path }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify(Object.assign({ message: 'nightly backup ' + $now.toISODate(), content: $('Make file').item.json.content }, $json.sha ? { sha: $json.sha } : {})) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3f06b1b-a66b-42a8-ad02-7691234258cb",
      "name": "Commit file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Same credential, two hosts\nSelect the \"GitHub backup\" credential in both GitHub nodes and \"n8n API\" in Get all workflows. Keep the repo private: workflow files contain credential names and IDs (not secrets).",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 340
      },
      "id": "acab4f49-9f0f-4171-9a1f-da75ed24ec9d",
      "name": "Sticky Note 7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        -260
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
